    "• Ensure your workspace has bright, even lighting" : {

    },
    "• Keep the workpiece centered inside the viewfinder frame" : {

    },
    "• Move closer to the component area" : {

    },
    "• Power Rails (+ and -): Run vertically down the side columns. Red (+) is positive voltage (5V/3.3V), Blue/Black (-) is ground (GND)." : {

    },
    "• Tie-Point Rows (A–E, F–J): Connected horizontally across each row number. Inserting two leads into the same numbered row (e.g. 10A and 10B) connects them electrically." : {

    },
